-- src:5329 | this Act for non-payment of the amount of any fine, compensation or
-- src:5330 | damages, with the costs assessed and directed to be paid by any order
-- src:5331 | of court, the amount so ordered is deemed to be liquidated and
-- src:5332 | discharged, and the order is annulled.
@ref s 135 (src:5327-5332)
GIVEN `imprisonment has been suffered under this Act for non-payment of the amount of a fine, compensation or damages, with the costs assessed and directed to be paid by an order of court, and has been determined` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a special provision to the contrary in this Act applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 135 the order is annulled` MEANS
